     6	 * built static HTML page. The in-frame selection agent (`selectionAgent.ts
     7	 * resolveRef`) parses that attribute into a `SourceRef{kind:'source', oid, file,
     8	 * line}` and ships it in the SelectionEnvelope.
     9	 *
    10	 * This module is the host-side counterpart of `deckResolver.ts`: pure helpers
    11	 * that turn a raw `data-oid` string into a `{file, line}` (for forming the edit
    12	 * steer instruction) and a human label (for the edit affordance header). It does
    13	 * NOT touch the DOM — the in-frame agent already walked up to the nearest stamped
    14	 * ancestor; here we only parse the resulting oid.
    15	 *
    16	 * @module appResolver
    17	 */
