    13	 *   `"slide-{i}:body:{j}"`     → `/slides/{i}/body/{j}`
    14	 *   `"slide-{i}:chart"`        → `/slides/{i}/chart`
    15	 *   `"slide-{i}:table"`        → `/slides/{i}/table`
